    PIN KE ESP

DHT21 = GPIO 4
Soil Sensor = GPIO 34
Relay 1(Fan) = GPIO 26
Relay 2(Pompa) = GPIO 27
LCD (SDA) = GPIO 21
LCD (SCL) = GPIO 22

Suhu > 35C = Fan ON, Kelembaban Tanah < 40% = Pompa ON.
